WEBVTT

00:00.930 --> 00:02.920
<i>(Isn't that maybe how love's defined?)</i>

00:02.920 --> 00:04.650
<i>Wow! A gift for you!</i>

00:04.650 --> 00:06.520
<i>(So, isn't that true love defined?)</i>

00:11.930 --> 00:13.710
<i>Nothing happening,</i>

00:13.710 --> 00:15.910
<i>every day feels the same</i>

00:15.910 --> 00:17.320
<i>Over and over, just</i>

00:17.320 --> 00:19.400
<i>waiting for time to pass</i>

00:19.400 --> 00:21.420
<i>When I'm with you,</i>

00:21.420 --> 00:22.620
<i>I can feel</i>

00:22.620 --> 00:24.750
<i>something so special,</i>

00:24.750 --> 00:27.880
<i>and I want to make it real</i>

00:27.880 --> 00:30.380
<i>Look, I'm really grateful every day, but you know</i>

00:30.380 --> 00:32.270
<i>I feel like I'm not doing enough in return</i>

00:32.270 --> 00:33.920
<i>"I was just feeling like it.</i>

00:33.920 --> 00:35.720
<i>No real meaning or reason why."</i>

00:35.720 --> 00:40.110
<i>Stop complaining and just take it already!</i>

00:39.080 --> 00:40.960
<i>(Isn't that maybe how love's defined?)</i>

00:40.960 --> 00:43.520
<i>Yeah, there's no way that's how it goes!</i>

00:42.680 --> 00:44.320
<i>(So, isn't that true love defined?)</i>

00:44.320 --> 00:46.360
<i>Whoa oh oh oh oh</i>

00:46.360 --> 00:48.810
<i>An angel just landed</i>

00:48.810 --> 00:50.700
<i>Right in front of me</i>

00:50.700 --> 00:52.320
<i>With a smile that looked</i>

00:52.320 --> 00:53.990
<i>Like her wings spreading open</i>

00:53.990 --> 00:55.950
<i>Hey, that's against all the rules</i>

00:55.950 --> 00:57.360
<i>You look so happy</i>

00:57.360 --> 00:59.290
<i>Wipe off that look</i>

00:59.290 --> 01:01.180
<i>Before my mind goes blank</i>

01:01.180 --> 01:03.020
<i>If you keep this up,</i>

01:03.020 --> 01:05.640
<i>You're gonna spoil me rotten</i>

01:06.460 --> 01:09.760
<i>Come on, you gotta do something about this</i>

01:08.220 --> 01:10.480
<i>So, let's get started</i>

01:10.480 --> 01:11.610
<i>I want to know</i>

01:11.610 --> 01:13.640
<i>A lot more about</i>

01:13.640 --> 01:15.680
<i>The world you live in</i>

01:15.680 --> 01:17.880
<i>So, let's get started</i>

01:17.880 --> 01:18.910
<i>I want to laugh</i>

01:18.910 --> 01:20.890
<i>A lot more with you</i>

01:20.890 --> 01:23.050
<i>In the world you live in</i>

01:22.350 --> 01:26.640
The Angel Next Door
Spoils Me Rotten

01:23.050 --> 01:25.020
<i>I want to know more</i>

01:25.020 --> 01:27.690
<i>I want to laugh more</i>

01:29.980 --> 01:34.990
The Angel in the Dream

01:35.790 --> 01:39.880
By the way, are you doing anything 
for Mother's Day, Amane-kun?

01:39.880 --> 01:41.260
Well, yeah.

01:41.260 --> 01:44.540
Just sending a bouquet 
and a few things, though.

01:44.960 --> 01:49.070
If I was at home, 
I could have done a little more.

01:49.070 --> 01:50.910
Like help out around the house?

01:50.910 --> 01:54.090
Yeah, though it just ends up 
making more work for Mom and Dad.

01:54.920 --> 01:57.480
I'm surprised Shihoko-san 
and Shuto-san let you live alone

01:57.480 --> 02:01.180
when you're so utterly terrible 
at housework, Amane-kun.

02:02.600 --> 02:05.020
Fujimiya, good to see you again.

02:07.810 --> 02:11.630
I'm also surprised you thought 
it would be a good idea.

02:11.630 --> 02:12.490
Yeah.

02:13.120 --> 02:15.900
There were reasons 
I didn't want to stay at home.

02:19.970 --> 02:22.450
Hey, forget it.

02:22.450 --> 02:25.580
I mean, I don't want you 
worrying that much about me.

02:26.170 --> 02:28.890
It's not like something terrible happened.

02:31.540 --> 02:35.310
Basically, there were some guys 
I didn't want to be around anymore,

02:35.310 --> 02:37.160
so I decided to move away.

02:37.720 --> 02:41.050
Seriously, I'm fine. 
It's all behind me anyway.

02:42.170 --> 02:43.140
You liar.

02:45.140 --> 02:48.190
Liar? Now hold on...

02:48.190 --> 02:51.190
You wouldn't act like this 
if you were over it all.

02:52.140 --> 02:54.480
It's fine if you don't want to talk about it.

02:55.150 --> 02:59.610
But it's hard for me 
to see you hurting, Amane-kun.

03:01.800 --> 03:03.820
I'm really not, though.

03:04.240 --> 03:07.670
It just isn't a very fun 
or interesting story.

03:11.670 --> 03:13.580
Fine. Where should I begin?

03:14.930 --> 03:16.470
How do I put this...

03:17.190 --> 03:19.710
I think I'm pretty blessed.

03:19.710 --> 03:24.400
My parents took good care of me 
and our family was well-off.

03:24.400 --> 03:28.100
I always knew that they cared 
about me and loved me.

03:28.100 --> 03:30.870
Municipal Junior High

03:28.780 --> 03:33.560
But back then, I don't think 
I understood how lucky I was

03:33.560 --> 03:35.360
so I was too trusting with others.

03:36.320 --> 03:38.480
To be honest, I was really naïve.

03:39.760 --> 03:44.350
And because I was so naïve, 
people kept taking advantage of me.

03:45.260 --> 03:48.140
That Fujimiya kid is a riot, right?

03:48.140 --> 03:51.680
He looks like a dork 
but he acts like he's some hotshot.

03:51.680 --> 03:55.330
Don't be rude, man. 
He's always picking up the bill.

03:55.760 --> 03:58.650
Yeah, but that's 
the only thing he's good for.

03:58.650 --> 03:59.510
No kidding.

04:02.440 --> 04:08.010
And then, well, I caught them 
talking about me behind my back.

04:10.450 --> 04:11.680
You guys.

04:11.680 --> 04:14.810
Even with friends, there are 
some things you just shouldn't say.

04:15.150 --> 04:17.270
Huh? What are you talking about?

04:17.270 --> 04:21.070
You were never worth
 anything but money to us.

04:24.040 --> 04:27.320
Of course I realize 
not everybody's like that,

04:28.790 --> 04:33.710
and I knew some of my friends 
did like me for who I was,

04:34.440 --> 04:37.330
but I started to doubt them, 
and it scared me.

04:38.440 --> 04:39.840
I couldn't trust people anymore.

04:41.700 --> 04:43.900
So I decided to leave my home town.

04:44.520 --> 04:49.160
I wanted to start over again 
where nobody knew who I was.

04:50.770 --> 04:52.860
If I had been there with you,

04:52.860 --> 04:55.980
I would have punched those 
slimeballs square in the mouth.

04:58.720 --> 05:01.060
I don't want you to hurt your hands, Mahiru.

05:03.280 --> 05:07.210
And it was nowhere near 
as tough as you had it,

05:07.210 --> 05:08.920
so you don't need to be so sad about it.

05:08.920 --> 05:12.840
Amane-kun, those are 
two very different things.

05:12.840 --> 05:14.500
I don't want you comparing them.

05:17.790 --> 05:21.520
The pain you went through 
is something that only you can carry.

05:21.520 --> 05:24.460
It isn't any easier 
or any less meaningful than mine.

05:25.540 --> 05:26.550
Okay.

05:27.990 --> 05:34.090
All I can do is understand your sadness 
and try to hold you up.

05:35.000 --> 05:39.710
Just like you did for me, 
I want to support you, Amane-kun.

05:39.710 --> 05:41.420
I want you to depend on me.

05:41.840 --> 05:43.980
But all I ever do is depend on you.

05:43.980 --> 05:47.150
I mean emotionally, too, okay?

05:47.150 --> 05:48.860
Yeah, I'm always depending on you.

05:48.860 --> 05:50.480
Then do more.

05:50.480 --> 05:52.510
Would you quit pampering me?

05:52.510 --> 05:55.000
I'm going to pamper you as much as I can.

05:55.780 --> 05:57.080
You're gonna make me totally helpless.

05:57.080 --> 05:59.250
Oh, it's too late for that.

05:59.250 --> 06:02.800
I knew from the start that you were helpless.

06:03.350 --> 06:08.260
But I also knew that you're 
a really reliable, strong, good person.

06:09.120 --> 06:11.930
So when you're with me, 
let me spoil you a little.

06:15.360 --> 06:16.270
I don't need you to.

06:17.640 --> 06:19.900
Quit trying to act tough, Amane-kun.

06:19.900 --> 06:20.700
Dummy.

06:23.540 --> 06:26.010
Quit grumbling 
and let your guard down a little.

06:26.770 --> 06:28.730
You're super pushy.

06:28.730 --> 06:30.610
Oh, you've finally noticed?

06:31.350 --> 06:34.200
Girls can be a little insistent sometimes.

06:35.540 --> 06:39.420
And I'm the type 
who likes to repay what I owe.

06:40.530 --> 06:45.930
I really depended on you before. 
I confided in you.

06:47.690 --> 06:51.290
So now it's your turn. You can confide in me.

06:51.760 --> 06:53.530
It's just part of what I owe you.

06:54.690 --> 06:56.180
You'll get change back.

06:56.860 --> 06:59.100
Why don't you hang on to that for now?

06:59.770 --> 07:05.610
The next time I'm down, you'll reach out 
to me again, and then we'll be even.

07:19.860 --> 07:22.370
Let's make sure this doesn't happen again.

07:22.990 --> 07:26.140
I don't want to see you depressed, Amane-kun,

07:26.140 --> 07:29.030
so next time let's make it 
happen <i>sooner</i>, okay?

07:29.880 --> 07:31.550
I'm not sure that's...

07:32.310 --> 07:34.670
Why are you looking away from me?

07:34.670 --> 07:37.100
I don't want to be 
dependent on you like this.

07:37.400 --> 07:39.930
I mean... I'm a guy, you know.

07:40.320 --> 07:41.890
Yes, I'm very aware of that.

07:42.480 --> 07:45.360
You really don't get it, do you? Geez.

07:45.360 --> 07:47.840
You're the one who doesn't get it, Amane-kun.

07:47.840 --> 07:49.130
What don't I get?

07:49.130 --> 07:52.320
All of it. Everything. Dummy.

07:53.890 --> 07:57.080
You know I'd never 
treat anyone else like this.

08:03.400 --> 08:05.600
Wh-What are you doing?

08:05.600 --> 08:08.880
Oh, it's just fine from the front, 
but you flinch when it's from behind?

08:10.290 --> 08:12.510
Anyone would if you surprise them like this!

08:12.880 --> 08:15.210
You told me to lean on you.

08:16.100 --> 08:17.180
Don't you dare turn around.

08:19.440 --> 08:20.060
Dummy!

08:20.770 --> 08:22.920
<i>Yeah, she's right. I'm dumb.</i>

08:24.690 --> 08:29.270
I'm a selfish guy. I held on to you 
because I knew you'd let me.

08:29.740 --> 08:32.240
You've always been selfish.

08:33.160 --> 08:34.790
Yeah, sorry about that.

08:35.280 --> 08:38.620
If you're going to be selfish anyway, 
why stop yourself?

08:39.590 --> 08:44.120
I'm selfish too, though, 
so I'm in no position to complain.

08:44.460 --> 08:46.640
When have you ever been selfish?

08:46.640 --> 08:48.040
Gosh, I wonder when.

08:48.640 --> 08:49.250
Huh?

08:50.880 --> 08:55.340
You've got a long way to go if you still 
can't see how selfish I am, Amane-kun.

09:05.230 --> 09:07.530
<i>You're a dummy, too, Mahiru.</i>

09:08.270 --> 09:09.680
<i>A real dummy.</i>

09:19.680 --> 09:21.290
<i>I gotta work on myself.</i>

09:21.720 --> 09:25.290
<i>I'm done feeling embarrassed 
when I stand next to Mahiru.</i>

09:27.120 --> 09:28.960
H-Hey, Shiina-san?

09:28.960 --> 09:31.630
Yes, what is it?

09:31.630 --> 09:38.140
Um, I heard a rumor that you were walking 
around the mall with a boy the other day.

09:39.510 --> 09:41.770
Yes, I was walking around.

09:44.550 --> 09:48.310
Um, so who was that person to you?

09:49.570 --> 09:52.230
Who was he to me?

09:52.230 --> 09:55.230
I guess it would be accurate
 to call him a friend.

09:55.230 --> 09:56.110
A friend?

09:56.110 --> 09:57.400
Phew.

09:57.400 --> 10:00.490
So I guess it wasn't a date, then?

10:00.490 --> 10:03.240
A date, you say? Hmm.

10:03.830 --> 10:08.330
Well, strictly speaking, 
I suppose it was a date.

10:11.750 --> 10:14.380
Wh-What do you mean, exactly?

10:15.040 --> 10:17.550
Well, we aren't going out, but...

10:18.420 --> 10:22.870
honestly, there's no one more 
dear to me in life than him.

10:24.030 --> 10:28.980
The Angel Next Door
Spoils Me Rotten

10:29.770 --> 10:31.840
It wasn't a lie, though.

10:32.980 --> 10:36.180
I know we've only spent 
about half a year together,

10:36.180 --> 10:40.330
but every single day of that time 
has been fulfilling for me.

10:41.680 --> 10:45.290
As someone who never really 
became involved in others' lives,

10:45.290 --> 10:49.260
I feel closer to you than anyone 
I've ever met, Amane-kun.

10:50.420 --> 10:53.260
The world I live in is actually very small.

10:53.760 --> 10:57.020
All of my friends could fit 
in the palm of my hand.

10:59.860 --> 11:03.930
And among those, you are the closest, 
dearest person to me.

11:04.630 --> 11:07.430
You see me for who I am.

11:07.950 --> 11:09.310
Mahiru...

11:09.730 --> 11:14.440
And that's why I still think you should be 
more confident in yourself.

11:17.420 --> 11:23.070
By now, you must know that I 
trust you more than anyone else.

11:23.620 --> 11:28.200
But you must have known people would get 
the wrong idea when you said it like that.

11:29.000 --> 11:31.540
Yes, and that was my intention.

11:32.080 --> 11:34.220
We both know that if I had 
dodged the question,

11:34.220 --> 11:37.620
they would have imagined 
weird things on their own.

11:38.130 --> 11:39.800
Yeah, I guess you're right.

11:40.210 --> 11:45.470
It's easier to manage the rumors 
if we drop a little information at a time.

11:47.000 --> 11:48.270
Very well, then.

11:48.770 --> 11:53.060
But at least warn me first, okay? 
Otherwise I might get the wrong idea, too.

11:53.990 --> 11:55.520
The wrong idea?

11:56.180 --> 12:00.660
If I had picked the same moment 
to say you're "dear" to me,

12:00.660 --> 12:02.700
you would've thought it meant 
something, too, right?

12:03.830 --> 12:07.890
I doubt you would disclose something 
like that to other people in the first place.

12:08.700 --> 12:10.330
You're probably right.

12:10.670 --> 12:12.830
Or would you be willing to admit it?

12:16.390 --> 12:22.760
Being popular is difficult because people 
watch you and judge your friendships.

12:23.340 --> 12:27.140
But here, it's just the two of us. 
Nobody else can judge.

12:27.630 --> 12:30.270
I'm content with that for now.

12:33.690 --> 12:36.160
Training? You are?

12:36.160 --> 12:39.270
Yeah. So I might be out 
a little more than usual.

12:39.270 --> 12:40.780
All of a sudden?

12:40.780 --> 12:43.780
I'm glad you're exercising, 
but is there some reason for it?

12:44.160 --> 12:45.570
Hmm.

12:45.570 --> 12:49.660
Male pride? I guess I just want to 
try to look a little sharper.

12:49.660 --> 12:50.900
Oh, my.

12:50.900 --> 12:55.420
I never expected to hear that from someone 
who lives such a slovenly lifestyle.

12:56.660 --> 12:59.730
It must be exhausting 
since you aren't used to it yet.

12:59.730 --> 13:01.460
Would it help if I spoiled you a little?

13:01.460 --> 13:03.050
You mean again?

13:04.560 --> 13:08.510
Whenever you wish, I will indulge you 
in whatever your heart desires.

13:09.170 --> 13:12.430
You seriously look like you'd do 
anything I ask, and that terrifies me.

13:12.430 --> 13:14.640
As long as it's within my abilities.

13:14.640 --> 13:16.740
Of course, I would expect 
something in return.

13:16.740 --> 13:20.120
What sort of thing do you mean?

13:22.490 --> 13:26.200
I would ask you for a favor, too.

13:26.200 --> 13:30.030
Sure, if it's something I can do. 
So a fair exchange.

13:30.510 --> 13:32.540
Mine might be a little greedier, though.

13:33.080 --> 13:35.750
Then, for practice, 
try asking me something.

13:38.960 --> 13:42.200
I-I think we should...

13:42.200 --> 13:43.210
Yeah?

13:44.280 --> 13:45.590
Slee—

13:45.590 --> 13:46.840
So I...

13:46.840 --> 13:47.720
Soy?

13:48.940 --> 13:50.900
P-Please pat my head again!

13:50.900 --> 13:52.510
Is that enough?

13:52.510 --> 13:53.430
That's enough!

13:56.920 --> 14:01.060
I like it when you touch me, Amane-kun.

14:15.830 --> 14:17.080
I really like you.

14:23.300 --> 14:25.370
Will you touch me... more?

14:39.220 --> 14:41.020
<i>I'm so disgusting.</i>

14:44.660 --> 14:45.980
I wanna die.

14:47.060 --> 14:47.990
Hey, Amane.

14:49.210 --> 14:51.480
Why do you look so dead?

14:55.030 --> 14:58.960
Uh... Yeah, I went running this morning.

14:59.330 --> 15:01.230
Oh, no wonder you look so dazed!

15:01.230 --> 15:05.050
Anyone this out of shape 
would be wiped out after a run.

15:05.780 --> 15:11.510
If you aren't feeling well, you should go 
straight home after school to rest.

15:11.880 --> 15:15.600
Thanks for looking out for me. 
But I'm fine, so don't worry.

15:22.740 --> 15:24.060
Are you angry with me?

15:24.570 --> 15:26.610
Of course not.

15:26.610 --> 15:30.160
You only answer like that when you are angry.

15:30.740 --> 15:34.450
Did I do something wrong 
without realizing it?

15:34.780 --> 15:38.410
N-No, you didn't! 
It isn't your fault, Mahiru.

15:38.770 --> 15:40.820
Sorry if I made things weird.

15:40.820 --> 15:44.690
Then why have you been so cold to me today?

15:44.690 --> 15:48.030
Ah! Uh, well, I mean...

15:48.030 --> 15:50.470
I guess I have a lot on my mind.

15:51.060 --> 15:54.260
Could it be that you don't like me anymore?

15:54.560 --> 15:56.770
That isn't it at all!

15:56.770 --> 16:02.380
I-It's something private. 
A bunch of stuff going on in my head.

16:02.380 --> 16:04.460
Won't you tell me about it?

16:05.410 --> 16:08.030
<i>How am I supposed to explain </i>that<i>?</i>

16:09.660 --> 16:13.070
So I... seduced you, Amane-kun?

16:13.070 --> 16:15.030
I feel so bad about it.

16:15.030 --> 16:18.700
I always try really hard 
not to think of you that way.

16:19.500 --> 16:23.310
Inside your dream, 
how did I come on to you?

16:23.310 --> 16:25.880
Huh? Are you into humiliation or something?!

16:26.490 --> 16:28.190
Into humiliation?

16:28.830 --> 16:32.800
Uh, no. But if I did something 
so wild that it upset you,

16:32.800 --> 16:35.050
I thought that information 
might come in handy later.

16:35.050 --> 16:39.830
You don't need to know! 
And handy for what, exactly?!

16:39.830 --> 16:42.260
To make you excited, maybe?

16:42.260 --> 16:45.060
Please stop playing with my weak heart.

16:46.460 --> 16:48.560
Amane-kun, you're one of the...

16:48.560 --> 16:53.570
I mean, out of all the boys I know, 
you're easily the most innocent.

16:53.570 --> 16:56.160
Shut up. I could say 
the exact same about you.

16:56.160 --> 17:01.300
True. I've never felt like spending time 
with any other gentlemen,

17:01.300 --> 17:04.000
and you're the only person 
I've ever gotten this close to.

17:04.550 --> 17:07.920
I-I haven't gotten serious 
with any girls before, either!

17:08.820 --> 17:11.520
Well, I guess that's my 
good news for the day.

17:11.520 --> 17:12.610
Good news?

17:13.170 --> 17:17.380
That I'm the first real contact 
you've had with the opposite sex.

17:17.380 --> 17:19.900
Wha?! That's literally not...

17:19.900 --> 17:23.480
Um, I guess it's literally true. 
But what a creepy way to put it!

17:23.840 --> 17:27.600
What's wrong with it? 
This is my first time with all this, too.

17:27.600 --> 17:29.610
Your first... time?

17:31.620 --> 17:32.660
Amane-kun?

17:32.660 --> 17:35.400
It's nothing but may I ask you 
to stop looking at me?

17:36.100 --> 17:37.410
Who are you?

17:37.410 --> 17:38.240
Just drop it!

17:39.910 --> 17:41.600
Fine, I won't look.

17:42.450 --> 17:45.070
This way, I'm not looking. Right?

17:45.560 --> 17:47.330
That is quite true.

17:47.970 --> 17:51.920
You avoided me all day, so just deal with it.

17:54.670 --> 17:56.930
<b>Seijo High School</b>

17:55.630 --> 17:57.820
Is it test time already?

17:57.820 --> 18:01.430
This sucks! What's with this schedule?

17:58.680 --> 18:01.430
<b>Second Year, First Semester Midterm Exam Schedule</b>

17:58.680 --> 18:01.430
<b>1st Period</b>

17:58.680 --> 18:01.430
<b>2nd Period</b>

17:58.680 --> 18:01.430
<b>3rd Period</b>

17:58.680 --> 18:01.430
<b>May 20</b>

17:58.680 --> 18:01.430
<b>Classics</b>

17:58.680 --> 18:01.430
<b>English</b>

17:58.680 --> 18:01.430
<b>World History</b>

18:02.030 --> 18:03.230
Hey, Mahiru.

18:03.230 --> 18:07.700
Me, Itsuki, and Kadowaki are having a study 
party tomorrow morning. Is that okay?

18:07.700 --> 18:09.730
I don't mind at all.

18:09.730 --> 18:12.770
Shall I make enough food for the others, too?

18:12.770 --> 18:15.110
Well, I don't want to bother you with that.

18:15.460 --> 18:18.320
I'll just make more of the same dish, 
so it's no trouble.

18:19.110 --> 18:22.460
But then, would you mind if I joined you?

18:22.460 --> 18:25.020
If you want to, I'm sure Itsuki 
and Kadowaki are okay with it.

18:26.410 --> 18:27.790
Wanna invite Chitose, too?

18:28.240 --> 18:30.220
Actually, she's already invited.

18:30.220 --> 18:30.750
Huh?

18:32.580 --> 18:34.430
Save me, Mahirun!

18:34.430 --> 18:38.810
If I don't get a good score 
on this test, my dad's gonna kill me!

18:39.690 --> 18:41.560
...is what Chitose-san said,

18:41.560 --> 18:45.180
so I already made a promise 
to study with her tomorrow.

18:45.180 --> 18:47.930
It sounds like you fell into her trap.

18:49.000 --> 18:52.560
So you really want to do well 
on your tests this time?

18:53.070 --> 18:56.370
Yeah, I thought it would boost my confidence.

18:56.370 --> 18:59.030
It'd be great to get into the top ten.

18:59.520 --> 19:04.050
Is that your goal? Then perhaps 
I can help add to your motivation.

19:04.050 --> 19:05.030
My motivation?

19:05.310 --> 19:10.000
If you get within the top ten, Amane-kun, 
I'll do anything you ask me to.

19:10.000 --> 19:11.480
Huh?!

19:11.480 --> 19:16.300
I'll even grant you the kind of thing 
you'd never normally ask for.

19:17.030 --> 19:21.130
B-But if I asked you something really risky? 
Then what would you do?

19:21.640 --> 19:23.490
Well, that depends,

19:23.490 --> 19:27.770
but I think I'd be impressed by your 
masculine audacity and grant it anyway.

19:30.700 --> 19:33.610
Okay, then let me lie 
on your lap like before.

19:40.700 --> 19:42.570
All right, then.

19:42.570 --> 19:46.640
I'll even give you an ear cleaning, 
so just leave everything to me.

19:47.750 --> 19:49.410
Thanks for having us over!

19:49.410 --> 19:51.550
Yeah. Come on in.

19:51.550 --> 19:52.370
Where's Mahirun?

19:53.130 --> 19:55.290
She's in the kitchen getting lunch ready.

19:56.140 --> 19:57.700
Mahirun!

19:57.700 --> 19:59.260
Welcome, everyone.

19:59.260 --> 20:00.920
Thanks for having us!

20:01.660 --> 20:03.120
Is something wrong?

20:03.120 --> 20:08.510
No... Shiina-san just looks 
totally natural in your home, Fujimiya.

20:09.720 --> 20:13.370
Of course she does. 
She comes over all the time to cook for me.

20:14.190 --> 20:16.190
<b>Math II</b>

20:14.190 --> 20:16.190
<b>Japanese History</b>

20:14.190 --> 20:16.190
<b>Physics</b>

20:15.460 --> 20:19.630
Um, what parts are you 
having trouble with, Chitose-san?

20:19.630 --> 20:20.800
All of them.

20:20.800 --> 20:22.570
A-All of them?

20:22.860 --> 20:26.240
You have to want to do it, Itsuki.

20:27.800 --> 20:29.680
You can't just laugh it off, man.

20:29.680 --> 20:32.620
Yuta! Amane's such a meanie!

20:33.140 --> 20:35.390
Isn't it about time we get serious, Itsuki?

20:36.100 --> 20:37.670
Okay...

20:56.260 --> 20:57.650
For all your hard work.

20:57.650 --> 20:59.210
Oh, thank you.

21:00.430 --> 21:03.430
You're really the caring type, aren't you?

21:03.430 --> 21:06.030
I'm only caring to the people
 I want to care about.

21:07.750 --> 21:09.120
What does that mean?

21:09.770 --> 21:11.540
What do you think it means?

21:13.220 --> 21:17.440
You're scared to take your eyes off of the
 loser who can't take care of himself?

21:18.070 --> 21:18.960
Sure, I guess so.

21:19.750 --> 21:23.170
Without me, you're 
completely helpless, Amane-kun.

21:24.180 --> 21:26.090
There's nothing I can say to that.

21:26.090 --> 21:31.140
It's fine with me. 
I love taking care of you, Amane-kun.

21:33.740 --> 21:35.230
<i>She's wearing me down...</i>

21:36.110 --> 21:39.370
<i>Soon my body won't be able 
to survive without Mahiru.</i>

21:52.570 --> 21:55.580
I'm more than happy to spoil you, Amane-kun,

21:55.580 --> 21:58.750
so just relax and stay helpless, okay?

22:05.390 --> 22:07.840
<i>Outer space is huge</i>

22:07.840 --> 22:10.240
<i>But only one of these planets</i>

22:10.240 --> 22:12.540
<i>Is our own blue planet, Earth</i>

22:12.540 --> 22:14.930
<i>And in that huge world</i>

22:14.930 --> 22:17.310
<i>A little message of love</i>

22:17.310 --> 22:19.650
<i>Is on its way to you</i>

22:19.650 --> 22:21.930
<i>Trying to make its way</i>

22:21.930 --> 22:24.840
<i>To you on that little island</i>

22:25.410 --> 22:27.790
<i>Ever since we first met</i>

22:27.790 --> 22:30.110
<i>There's a lot we've been through</i>

22:30.110 --> 22:32.560
<i>All these feelings I have</i>

22:32.560 --> 22:34.950
<i>Keep filling more letters, too</i>

22:34.950 --> 22:37.290
<i>Before you know it</i>

22:37.290 --> 22:39.580
<i>We’ll be singing together</i>

22:39.580 --> 22:41.900
<i>Sometimes powerful</i>

22:41.900 --> 22:44.220
<i>Sometimes heartbreaking</i>

22:44.220 --> 22:46.670
<i>When that song starts ringing out</i>

22:46.670 --> 22:49.050
<i>It will be heard far away</i>

22:49.050 --> 22:51.390
<i>And that sweet song</i>

22:51.390 --> 22:57.270
<i>Will change the world</i>

22:57.270 --> 23:01.070
<i>Listen, the one person</i>

23:01.070 --> 23:03.360
<i>Who's dearest to you</i>

23:03.360 --> 23:06.690
<i>Is right next to you</i>

23:06.690 --> 23:10.430
<i>I just want to send this your way</i>

23:10.430 --> 23:12.780
<i>I'm hoping it will reach</i>

23:12.780 --> 23:16.120
<i>Please hear my love song</i>

23:16.120 --> 23:20.630
<i>Listen</i>

23:20.630 --> 23:25.420
<i>Listen</i>

23:25.420 --> 23:30.470
<i>Listen</i>

23:30.470 --> 23:34.200
<i>Please hear my love song</i>

23:34.970 --> 23:39.980
Next Time

23:35.330 --> 23:39.980
The Angel Next Door
Spoils Me Rotten
